    schema={"schema_version":CHATGPT_PROCESSING_SCHEMA_VERSION,"package_id":planner_id,"manual_exchange_only":True,"grouping_quality_rubric":grouping_rubric,"result_contract":"Return one JSON object matching response_template. Every catalog VIDEO_ID must appear exactly once in precise topic subgroup arrays and exactly once in the matching parent_groups layer. Put transcript_available=true videos only in transcript_groups and parent_groups.transcript_parent_groups. Put transcript_available=false videos only in no_transcript_groups and parent_groups.no_transcript_parent_groups. Parent groups are compatibility metadata only; they do not control final package size. There is no minimum parent-group size. VideoHoarder later minimizes actual package count with a hard maximum of 30 videos and workload limits. Never mix transcript and no-transcript videos. Also return title_suggestions for every VIDEO_ID with a clear English title, translating Hindi/other-language titles when possible from supplied title/description/category only. Follow grouping_quality_rubric. Do not invent, omit, duplicate, or change IDs.","response_template":template}
    prompt={"manual_exchange_notice":"Manual exchange only: upload the single PLANNER_PACKAGE JSON. Nothing is uploaded by VideoHoarder.","recommended_chatgpt_mode":"Thinking / strongest reasoning mode available","grouping_quality_rubric":grouping_rubric,"instructions":"Group every video into precise topic subgroups for classification and research organization, then assign those subgroups into larger parent_groups for actual ChatGPT package creation. Hierarchy: parent_group -> topic_subgroups -> video_ids. Use only the supplied title, description, categories, transcript availability, transcript size, video duration and video type. Parent groups are compatibility guidance only: there is no minimum size and ChatGPT must not optimize numeric package counts. Combine closely related subgroups into useful broader affinity groups, but leave actual package boundaries to VideoHoarder. The deterministic optimizer later minimizes package count with hard maximum 30 and workload limits; every transcript-available video appears exactly once in transcript_parent_groups; every no-transcript video appears exactly once in no_transcript_parent_groups; never mix transcript and no-transcript videos. Return one final JSON object only. Give each topic subgroup and parent group a self-explanatory name and substantive reason. Also propose a better English title for each video; translate Hindi or other-language titles to English where possible, but do not invent details beyond supplied catalog text.","response_template":template}
